# --- regenerable experiment outputs --------------------------------------
# The dataset (~10 MB) rebuilds in ~20s and the models in ~70s, so neither is
# worth versioning; `make pipeline` reproduces both. The evaluation report and
# its charts ARE committed, because they are the evidence for every number in
# the README, and so is the recorded capture that `make replay` uses.
experiments/dataset/
experiments/artifacts/
experiments/captures/demo.jsonl

*.jsonl
!experiments/captures/*.jsonl.gz
